1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Video ya leo inahusu nini? Ni kuhusu mazungumzo katika saloni au kinyozi. Kuzungumza huko kunaweza kuwa hatari!

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:13,008
Sehemu ya 1: Misingi ya Huduma kwa Wateja

3
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:15,674
Karibu sana.

4
00:00:15,697 --> 00:00:19,330
Je, umefanya mipango?

5
00:00:19,353 --> 00:00:23,687
Ndiyo, nilifanya mipango saa nne asubuhi.

6
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:26,343
Ninaitwa Yamada.

7
00:00:26,366 --> 00:00:29,033
Bwana Yamada, ndiyo?

8
00:00:29,056 --> 00:00:32,325
Tumekulinda.

9
00:00:32,348 --> 00:00:34,983
Asante sana.

10
00:00:35,007 --> 00:00:38,907
Tutakushughulikia mizigo yako.

11
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:42,087
Ndiyo, asante.

12
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:44,745
Hii ndiyo mfuko wangu.

13
00:00:44,769 --> 00:00:48,736
Je, tutashughulikia pia koti lako?

14
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:52,638
Aa, ndiyo. Asante.

15
00:00:52,661 --> 00:00:55,765
Tafadhali njoo hapa.

16
00:00:55,788 --> 00:00:58,545
Tutakuelekeza kwenye kiti chako.

17
00:00:58,569 --> 00:01:01,207
Asante sana.

18
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:04,897
Leo hali ya hewa ni nzuri, sivyo?

19
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:07,858
Ndiyo, ni nzuri.

20
00:01:07,881 --> 00:01:11,715
Ni joto kidogo leo.

21
00:01:11,737 --> 00:01:15,571
Ndiyo, nje ni joto.

22
00:01:15,594 --> 00:01:19,627
Hapa ndani ni baridi.

23
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:22,150
Ni vizuri.

24
00:01:22,173 --> 00:01:25,673
Je, ungependa kinywaji?

25
00:01:25,696 --> 00:01:29,037
Nitapenda maji, tafadhali.

26
00:01:29,061 --> 00:01:31,928
Vema, bwana.

27
00:01:31,951 --> 00:01:35,817
Nitakuletea maji baridi.

28
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:38,474
Asante sana.

29
00:01:38,497 --> 00:01:41,063
Asante sana.

30
00:01:41,086 --> 00:01:45,228
Mhudumu wako atakujia hivi punde.

31
00:01:45,252 --> 00:01:48,752
Sawa, nitangoja.

32
00:01:48,775 --> 00:01:51,710
Tafadhali subiri kidogo.

33
00:01:51,733 --> 00:01:54,600
Sawa.

34
00:01:54,623 --> 00:02:01,728
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua tena video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na kwenye ukaguzi wa kwanza. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

35
00:02:01,728 --> 00:02:04,728
Sehemu ya 2: Jinsi ya Kuangalia Muda wa Kucheki

36
00:02:04,728 --> 00:02:08,028
Karibu sana.

37
00:02:08,051 --> 00:02:10,751
Samahani,

38
00:02:10,774 --> 00:02:16,130
Sijafanya mipango, je, ni sawa?

39
00:02:16,153 --> 00:02:20,526
Ndiyo, hakuna matatizo.

40
00:02:20,550 --> 00:02:24,716
Je, kuna watu wengi sasa?

41
00:02:24,739 --> 00:02:27,673
Ndiyo, ni nzuri.

42
00:02:27,697 --> 00:02:32,364
Kuna wateja wawili mbele yako.

43
00:02:32,387 --> 00:02:36,464
Nitakaa muda gani?

44
00:02:36,488 --> 00:02:40,397
Utakaa kwa muda wa dakika thelathini hivi.

45
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:43,171
Sawa.

46
00:02:43,195 --> 00:02:45,361
Nitangoja.

47
00:02:45,384 --> 00:02:50,418
Tafadhali kaa kwenye kiti hicho na ngoja.

48
00:02:50,441 --> 00:02:56,074
Sawa, naweza kusoma gazeti?

49
00:02:56,097 --> 00:02:59,130
Ndiyo, bila shaka.

50
00:02:59,153 --> 00:03:01,420
Tafadhali.

51
00:03:01,443 --> 00:03:04,309
Asante sana.

52
00:03:04,332 --> 00:03:09,847
Msimu huu wa mvua una mvua nyingi, sivyo?

53
00:03:09,871 --> 00:03:14,337
Ndiyo, mvua inanyesha sana.

54
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:17,929
Je, una mwavuli?

55
00:03:17,952 --> 00:03:21,622
Ndiyo, nina mwavuli.

56
00:03:21,646 --> 00:03:25,821
Kishikilio cha mwavuli kipo karibu na mlango.

57
00:03:25,844 --> 00:03:29,678
Aa, nitakitoa hapa.

58
00:03:29,701 --> 00:03:32,697
Umechelewa kidogo.

59
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:36,359
Mtu wa kwanza, tafadhali.

60
00:03:36,383 --> 00:03:39,549
Ndio, mimi ndiye.

61
00:03:39,572 --> 00:03:43,521
Tafadhali keti kwenye kiti hiki.

62
00:03:43,544 --> 00:03:47,111
Asante sana.

63
00:03:47,134 --> 00:03:57,142
Ukisikia, tafadhali ongeza maoni.

64
00:03:57,142 --> 00:04:00,142
Sehemu ya 3: Jinsi ya Kubadilisha Mtindo wa Nywele na Rangi yake / Jinsi ya Kubadilisha Mtindo wa Nywele na Rangi Yako

65
00:04:00,142 --> 00:04:05,009
Leo utataka mtindo gani wa nywele?

66
00:04:05,032 --> 00:04:09,965
Ningependa nizipunguze kidogo.

67
00:04:09,988 --> 00:04:13,488
Ungependa nizikate kwa kiasi gani?

68
00:04:13,511 --> 00:04:18,883
Tafadhali nikatetee sentimita tatu kwa jumla.

69
00:04:18,907 --> 00:04:21,479
Sawa.

70
00:04:21,503 --> 00:04:25,437
Unywele wa mbele utaufanya vipi?

71
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:31,360
Unywele wa mbele unaweza ukawa juu ya macho.

72
00:04:31,383 --> 00:04:33,928
Vema, bwana.

73
00:04:33,951 --> 00:04:37,950
Je, ungependa kubadilisha rangi ya nywele pia?

74
00:04:37,974 --> 00:04:43,333
Ndio, ningependa rangi iwe angavu kidogo.

75
00:04:43,356 --> 00:04:47,189
Je, rangi kwenye picha hii inakupendeza?

76
00:04:47,212 --> 00:04:49,916
Nzuri sana.

77
00:04:49,939 --> 00:04:53,514
Tafadhali fanya rangi hiyo.

78
00:04:53,538 --> 00:04:56,857
Je, ungependa kupiga pama?

79
00:04:56,880 --> 00:05:01,113
Hapana, sipendi pama.

80
00:05:01,136 --> 00:05:03,670
Sawa.

81
00:05:03,692 --> 00:05:07,192
Kwa hivyo ni kukata na kubadilisha rangi, ndio?

82
00:05:07,216 --> 00:05:09,449
Ndio.

83
00:05:09,472 --> 00:05:12,550
Gharama yote ni kiasi gani?

84
00:05:12,574 --> 00:05:16,974
Jumla ni shilingi nane elfu.

85
00:05:16,997 --> 00:05:21,264
Itachukua muda gani?

86
00:05:21,287 --> 00:05:24,953
Itachukua saa mbili hivi.

87
00:05:24,976 --> 00:05:27,476
Sawa.

88
00:05:27,499 --> 00:05:29,809
Sawa tu.

89
00:05:29,833 --> 00:05:33,009
Basi, tuanze.

90
00:05:33,033 --> 00:05:35,982
Asante sana.

91
00:05:36,005 --> 00:05:41,705
Kama kuna chochote unachokihisi, tafadhali niambie.

92
00:05:41,728 --> 00:05:45,231
Ndio, nimeelewa.

93
00:05:45,254 --> 00:05:48,254
Sehemu ya 4: Maagizo ya Kunyolewa Nywele / Maagizo ya Kunyolewa Nywele

94
00:05:48,254 --> 00:05:52,087
Leo ungependa tufanye nini?

95
00:05:52,110 --> 00:05:55,810
Tafadhali fanya kama kawaida.

96
00:05:55,833 --> 00:06:00,733
Pande za upande na nyuma nitazipunguza.

97
00:06:00,757 --> 00:06:05,790
Ndio, tafadhali tumia mashine ya kunyolea.

98
00:06:05,813 --> 00:06:10,154
Mashine ya kunyolea ya milimita ngapi nitumie?

99
00:06:10,177 --> 00:06:14,557
Tafadhali nipunguze kwa milimita sita.

100
00:06:14,580 --> 00:06:18,847
Je, ungependa nywele za juu zikae ndefu?

101
00:06:18,870 --> 00:06:24,207
Hapana, tafadhali nipunguze juu pia kidogo.

102
00:06:24,231 --> 00:06:27,097
Vema, bwana.

103
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:30,877
Je, unywele wa pembeni utaufanya vipi?

104
00:06:30,901 --> 00:06:34,735
Tafadhali uwe wa urefu wa kawaida.

105
00:06:34,758 --> 00:06:37,991
Sawa.

106
00:06:38,014 --> 00:06:42,781
Je, tuifanye eneo la masikio liwe safi?

107
00:06:42,804 --> 00:06:48,870
Ndio, tafadhali hakikisha nywele hazifikii masikioni.

108
00:06:48,893 --> 00:06:52,685
Je, umbo la nywele za shingoni litafanywa vipi?

109
00:06:52,709 --> 00:06:56,613
Tafadhali liwe la asili.

110
00:06:56,636 --> 00:06:59,307
Sawa.

111
00:06:59,330 --> 00:07:02,597
Tutakata ndevu pia, ndio?

112
00:07:02,620 --> 00:07:08,053
Ndio, napenda kunyolewa ndevu pia.

113
00:07:08,076 --> 00:07:12,111
Je, tutaweka nyusi pia?

114
00:07:12,134 --> 00:07:17,077
Ndio, tafadhali nizipunguze kidogo.

115
00:07:17,101 --> 00:07:19,801
Vema, bwana.

116
00:07:19,824 --> 00:07:22,973
Sasa, tutaanza kukata.

117
00:07:22,997 --> 00:07:26,830
Asante sana.

118
00:07:26,853 --> 00:07:31,286
Kama unaumwa, tafadhali niambie mara moja.

119
00:07:31,309 --> 00:07:35,178
Ndio, nimeelewa.

120
00:07:35,202 --> 00:07:38,202
Sehemu ya 5: Shampuu katika Saluni / Kunawa kwa Nywele katika Saluni

121
00:07:38,202 --> 00:07:42,502
Tutakuelekeza kwenye eneo la kunawa.

122
00:07:42,525 --> 00:07:45,002
Ndio.

123
00:07:45,025 --> 00:07:48,925
Tafadhali kaa kwenye kiti hiki.

124
00:07:48,948 --> 00:07:52,505
Sawa, nitakaa.

125
00:07:52,529 --> 00:07:56,196
Sasa nitapindua kiti.

126
00:07:56,219 --> 00:07:58,919
Sawa.

127
00:07:58,942 --> 00:08:02,442
Shingo yako haumiani?

128
00:08:02,465 --> 00:08:06,098
Ndiyo, sijui shida.

129
00:08:06,121 --> 00:08:09,754
Joto la maji linakufaa?

130
00:08:09,777 --> 00:08:12,856
Ni la kutosha.

131
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:17,813
Maji hayako moto sana au baridi mno?

132
00:08:17,836 --> 00:08:21,569
Hapana tatizo lolote.

133
00:08:21,593 --> 00:08:25,426
Sasa, tutaanza kunawa.

134
00:08:25,449 --> 00:08:27,882
Tafadhali.

135
00:08:27,905 --> 00:08:32,057
Ninafanya vizuri kwa nguvu?

136
00:08:32,081 --> 00:08:36,435
Unaweza ongeza kidogo nguvu.

137
00:08:36,458 --> 00:08:40,425
Sawa, hivi vipo vizuri?

138
00:08:40,448 --> 00:08:44,915
Aa, ni tamu sana!

139
00:08:44,938 --> 00:08:48,639
Kuna sehemu inayowasha?

140
00:08:48,662 --> 00:08:51,581
Sawa tu.

141
00:08:51,605 --> 00:08:55,146
Sasa nitatiririsha maji.

142
00:08:55,169 --> 00:08:57,035
Ndio.

143
00:08:57,058 --> 00:08:59,976
Umechoka, asante.

144
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:03,136
Twende tena kwenye viti vyetu.

145
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:06,593
Asante sana.

146
00:09:06,616 --> 00:09:09,616
Sehemu ya 6: Maisha ya Kila Siku Yenye Mchakato na Safari ya Kupumzika Kwenye Maji Moto / Maisha ya Kila Siku Yenye Shughuli Nyingi na Safari ya Kupumzika Kwenye Maji Moto

147
00:09:09,616 --> 00:09:14,649
Hivi karibuni, kazi yako inakuwa nzito?

148
00:09:14,672 --> 00:09:16,811
Ndio.

149
00:09:16,835 --> 00:09:21,402
Kila siku ninafanya ziada ya saa.

150
00:09:21,425 --> 00:09:24,812
Hiyo ni ngumu sana.

151
00:09:24,836 --> 00:09:28,503
Una siku za kupumzika?

152
00:09:28,526 --> 00:09:35,433
Wikendi ninapumzika, lakini nimechoka sana na kulala tu.

153
00:09:35,456 --> 00:09:40,589
Ni vizuri wakati mwingine kupumzika kidogo.

154
00:09:40,612 --> 00:09:42,920
Ndiyo, ni nzuri.

155
00:09:42,944 --> 00:09:46,914
Ningependa kwenda mahali fulani.

156
00:09:46,937 --> 00:09:50,576
Maji moto yanavyofaa?

157
00:09:50,599 --> 00:09:53,333
Nzuri sana.

158
00:09:53,356 --> 00:09:58,189
Ningependa kwenda maji moto na kupumzika kidogo.

159
00:09:58,212 --> 00:10:04,118
Kuna maji moto mapya karibu na hapa.

160
00:10:04,142 --> 00:10:06,375
Kweli?

161
00:10:06,398 --> 00:10:09,316
Sikujua.

162
00:10:09,339 --> 00:10:14,607
Ndiyo, inasemekana ni safi sana na kubwa.

163
00:10:14,631 --> 00:10:19,185
Wikendi ijayo nitaweza kwenda.

164
00:10:19,209 --> 00:10:22,709
Tafadhali nenda uone.

165
00:10:22,731 --> 00:10:28,604
Kwa upande mwingine, duka hili limekuwepo kwa miaka mingapi?

166
00:10:28,628 --> 00:10:32,528
Tumekuwepo kwa miaka ishirini sasa.

167
00:10:32,551 --> 00:10:35,489
Ni ajabu!

168
00:10:35,512 --> 00:10:38,250
Muda mrefu sana.

169
00:10:38,274 --> 00:10:43,818
Kwa bahati nzuri, tuna wateja wanaokuja mara kwa mara.

170
00:10:43,841 --> 00:10:49,107
Napenda anasa ya duka hili.

171
00:10:49,130 --> 00:10:51,604
Asante sana.

172
00:10:51,628 --> 00:10:55,062
Ninashukuru sana.

173
00:10:55,085 --> 00:10:58,318
Nitakuja tena.

174
00:10:58,341 --> 00:11:01,315
Tutakutarajia.

175
00:11:01,339 --> 00:11:04,605
Asante sana.

176
00:11:04,628 --> 00:11:07,628
Sehemu ya 7: Jinsi ya Kupita Wakati Unapotumia Dawa / Jinsi ya Kupita Wakati Unapofua Dawa

177
00:11:07,628 --> 00:11:13,662
Sasa tutaweka dawa ya rangi.

178
00:11:13,685 --> 00:11:17,318
Ndiyo, asante.

179
00:11:17,341 --> 00:11:21,608
Je, inashika kwenye ngozi ya kichwa?

180
00:11:21,631 --> 00:11:26,331
Kwa sasa, hakuna tatizo.

181
00:11:26,354 --> 00:11:31,632
Ikiwa utasikia maumivu, niambie mara moja.

182
00:11:31,655 --> 00:11:35,171
Ndio, nimeelewa.

183
00:11:35,195 --> 00:11:40,152
Ungependa kusoma gazeti au kibodi?

184
00:11:40,175 --> 00:11:44,209
Nipatie kibodi tafadhali.

185
00:11:44,232 --> 00:11:47,365
Hii ndiyo.

186
00:11:47,388 --> 00:11:50,721
Unaweza pia kutazama video.

187
00:11:50,744 --> 00:11:54,011
Asante sana.

188
00:11:54,034 --> 00:11:57,586
Nitatazama filamu.

189
00:11:57,610 --> 00:12:01,676
Ungependa kahawa au chai?

190
00:12:01,699 --> 00:12:06,893
Basi, nipatie kahawa baridi tafadhali.

191
00:12:06,917 --> 00:12:11,250
Je, unataka maziwa na sukari?

192
00:12:11,273 --> 00:12:15,173
Maziwa tu tafadhali.

193
00:12:15,196 --> 00:12:18,229
Vema, bwana.

194
00:12:18,252 --> 00:12:21,352
Umechelewa kidogo.

195
00:12:21,375 --> 00:12:24,609
Hii ni kahawa baridi.

196
00:12:24,632 --> 00:12:27,498
Asante sana.

197
00:12:27,521 --> 00:12:30,155
Asante, nitakula.

198
00:12:30,178 --> 00:12:36,411
Tutangoja dakika ishirini hivi ili dawa iweze kuchukua rangi.

199
00:12:36,434 --> 00:12:41,209
Sawa, nitaketi polepole.

200
00:12:41,232 --> 00:12:43,932
Je, una baridi?

201
00:12:43,955 --> 00:12:48,748
Je, ungependa blanketi?

202
00:12:48,771 --> 00:12:51,742
Sawa tu.

203
00:12:51,766 --> 00:12:54,599
Sipati baridi.

204
00:12:54,622 --> 00:12:59,603
Ikiwa kuna chochote, niite.

205
00:12:59,627 --> 00:13:03,606
Sawa, asante sana.

206
00:13:03,629 --> 00:13:06,629
Sehemu ya 8: Hatua za Kunyoa Uso / Hatua za Kimsingi za Kunyoa Uso

207
00:13:06,629 --> 00:13:12,096
Sasa tutanyoa uso wako.

208
00:13:12,119 --> 00:13:15,152
Tutageuza kiti chini.

209
00:13:15,175 --> 00:13:18,509
Ndiyo, asante.

210
00:13:18,532 --> 00:13:23,765
Tutaweka taulo moto uso wako.

211
00:13:23,788 --> 00:13:28,130
Aa, inanifurahisha sana!

212
00:13:28,153 --> 00:13:31,490
Je, moto sana?

213
00:13:31,513 --> 00:13:36,111
Hapana, joto ni la kutosha.

214
00:13:36,135 --> 00:13:40,534
Sasa tutaweka krimu ya kunyoa.

215
00:13:40,558 --> 00:13:45,430
Je, ngozi yako ikoje?

216
00:13:45,453 --> 00:13:48,645
Je, imekauka?

217
00:13:48,669 --> 00:13:53,606
Inaweza kuwa imekauka kidogo.

218
00:13:53,629 --> 00:13:59,096
Basi, tutanyoa polepole.

219
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,713
Asante sana.

220
00:14:01,736 --> 00:14:05,869
Je, kuna sehemu inayouma?

221
00:14:05,892 --> 00:14:08,426
Sawa tu.

222
00:14:08,449 --> 00:14:11,834
Unafanya vizuri sana!

223
00:14:11,857 --> 00:14:15,090
Asante sana.

224
00:14:15,113 --> 00:14:19,068
Nafanya kila siku.

225
00:14:19,092 --> 00:14:21,792
Ndiyo, naona.

226
00:14:21,815 --> 00:14:24,515
Wewe ni mtaalamu!

227
00:14:24,538 --> 00:14:28,497
Sasa tutanyoa chini ya kidevu.

228
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:32,255
Tafadhali panda kichwa kidogo juu.

229
00:14:32,279 --> 00:14:36,446
Hivi ndivyo?

230
00:14:36,469 --> 00:14:40,102
Ndiyo, vizuri.

231
00:14:40,125 --> 00:14:43,392
Karibu tumemaliza.

232
00:14:43,415 --> 00:14:48,348
Nimeanza kusinzia.

233
00:14:48,371 --> 00:14:51,604
Pumzika polepole.

234
00:14:51,627 --> 00:14:53,961
Ndio.

235
00:14:53,984 --> 00:14:56,984
Sehemu ya 9: Kupanga Nywele Saluni / Kupanga Nywele Saluni

236
00:14:56,984 --> 00:15:01,022
Sasa tutakausha nywele zako.

237
00:15:01,046 --> 00:15:04,112
Ndiyo, asante.

238
00:15:04,135 --> 00:15:08,091
Rangi imekuwa nzuri sana!

239
00:15:08,114 --> 00:15:11,056
Ndiyo, kweli.

240
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:14,352
Nimependa sana.

241
00:15:14,375 --> 00:15:18,150
Sasa nitashughulikia muonekano wangu.

242
00:15:18,173 --> 00:15:21,806
Je, unahitaji kutumia waks?

243
00:15:21,829 --> 00:15:26,096
Ndiyo, tafadhali weka kidogo.

244
00:15:26,119 --> 00:15:30,752
Kwa kawaida huweka nywele zako mwenyewe?

245
00:15:30,775 --> 00:15:36,342
Ndiyo, siyo mzuri sana katika kuweka nywele.

246
00:15:36,366 --> 00:15:41,000
Waks hii ni rahisi kutumia.

247
00:15:41,023 --> 00:15:44,489
Nitumieje?

248
00:15:44,512 --> 00:15:50,903
Chukua kidogo kwenye mkono wako, kisha ufinyue kwa nywele zote.

249
00:15:50,927 --> 00:15:55,098
Sawa. Inaonekana rahisi.

250
00:15:55,122 --> 00:16:00,188
Kwa nywele za uso, weka kidogo mwishoni.

251
00:16:00,211 --> 00:16:03,002
Sawa.

252
00:16:03,026 --> 00:16:06,393
Nitajaribu kuanzia kesho.

253
00:16:06,416 --> 00:16:11,887
Kama utatumia mafuta ya nywele pia, nywele zako zitakuwa nzuri zaidi.

254
00:16:11,911 --> 00:16:15,064
Kweli?

255
00:16:15,087 --> 00:16:18,621
Mafuta gani yanafaa?

256
00:16:18,644 --> 00:16:23,746
Ninapendekeza yale yanayouzwa madukani.

257
00:16:23,769 --> 00:16:27,545
Basi, nitanunua moja pia.

258
00:16:27,568 --> 00:16:30,342
Asante sana.

259
00:16:30,366 --> 00:16:35,119
Sasa angalia nyuma kwa kioo.

260
00:16:35,142 --> 00:16:37,928
Nzuri sana.

261
00:16:37,952 --> 00:16:40,660
Ni kamili.

262
00:16:40,683 --> 00:16:43,550
Ni vizuri.

263
00:16:43,573 --> 00:16:46,206
Umechoka, asante.

264
00:16:46,229 --> 00:16:49,962
Asante sana.

265
00:16:49,985 --> 00:16:52,985
Mwisho wa 10: Kukatwa Nywele na Masaji kwa Kinyozi / Haircut and Massage at a Beauty Salon

266
00:16:52,985 --> 00:16:56,219
Kukatwa kwa nywele kumemalizika.

267
00:16:56,242 --> 00:16:59,579
Nyuma ikoje?

268
00:16:59,602 --> 00:17:03,584
Nionyeshe kwa kioo.

269
00:17:03,608 --> 00:17:07,204
Tafadhali, angalia.

270
00:17:07,227 --> 00:17:09,927
Iko hivi.

271
00:17:09,950 --> 00:17:13,183
Nimechangamka.

272
00:17:13,206 --> 00:17:16,939
Urefu ni sawa kabisa.

273
00:17:16,962 --> 00:17:19,944
Nimefurahi.

274
00:17:19,968 --> 00:17:23,534
Sasa nitakufanya masaji ya mabega.

275
00:17:23,557 --> 00:17:26,424
Tafadhali.

276
00:17:26,447 --> 00:17:30,204
Aa, hapo.

277
00:17:30,228 --> 00:17:33,328
Ni tamu sana.

278
00:17:33,351 --> 00:17:37,741
Mabega yako yameganda kidogo.

279
00:17:37,764 --> 00:17:44,064
Ndiyo, kwa sababu nimekuwa nikitumia kompyuta sana hivi karibuni.

280
00:17:44,087 --> 00:17:47,038
Umechoka.

281
00:17:47,062 --> 00:17:51,295
Pumzika polepole.

282
00:17:51,318 --> 00:17:55,152
Sawa, asante sana.

283
00:17:55,175 --> 00:17:59,369
Sasa ni wakati wa malipo.

284
00:17:59,392 --> 00:18:02,359
Tafadhali nenda kwenye kasir.

285
00:18:02,382 --> 00:18:05,882
Sawa. Ni bei gani?

286
00:18:05,905 --> 00:18:12,300
Kukatwa kwa nywele na kunyoa uso ni shilingi elfu nne na mia tano (4,500).

287
00:18:12,323 --> 00:18:16,590
Je, naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo?

288
00:18:16,613 --> 00:18:20,946
Ndiyo, unaweza kutumia kadi.

289
00:18:20,969 --> 00:18:26,003
Basi, nitumie kadi.

290
00:18:26,026 --> 00:18:28,665
Vema.

291
00:18:28,688 --> 00:18:33,054
Tafadhali ingiza nambari yako ya siri hapa.

292
00:18:33,077 --> 00:18:35,911
Ndio.

293
00:18:35,934 --> 00:18:38,846
Asante sana.

294
00:18:38,869 --> 00:18:43,373
Hii ni kadi yako na risiti.

295
00:18:43,397 --> 00:18:46,332
Asante sana.

296
00:18:46,356 --> 00:18:51,889
Mwisho unaopendekezwa ni baada ya mwezi mmoja.

297
00:18:51,912 --> 00:18:54,613
Sawa.

298
00:18:54,637 --> 00:18:57,273
Nitakuja tena.

299
00:18:57,296 --> 00:19:00,363
Asante sana.

300
00:19:00,386 --> 00:19:03,252
Endelea na tahadhari.

301
00:19:03,275 --> 00:19:06,209
Kwa heri.